---
import DocsPage from "../../layouts/DocsPage.astro"

export const prerender = true
---

<DocsPage id="cli-terminal">

          <p>
            Running <code>vector</code> with no subcommand starts the interactive agent in the current directory, or in the path you pass. It takes the same session flags as <code>run</code>: <code>--model</code>, <code>--agent</code>, <code>--prompt</code>, <code>--continue</code>, <code>--session</code> and <code>--fork</code>. <code>--mini</code> starts a minimal interface, and <code>--replay</code>, <code>--no-replay</code> and <code>--replay-limit</code> control how much history is redrawn when you resume or resize.
          </p>
          <p class="doc-cmd"><code>vector
vector ~/code/myapp --model anthropic/claude-sonnet-5</code><button class="doc-cmd-copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy this command">Copy</button></p>
</DocsPage>
